  "description": "Welcome to 65/50 Kirkham Hill Terrace, Maylands - a superbly located 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom apartment offering comfort, convenience, and breathtaking panoramic views across Perth.<br/><br/>Positioned in a highly sought-after riverside pocket, this clean and low-maintenance apartment delivers the perfect lock-and-leave lifestyle for professionals, couples, or anyone seeking easy-care living close to the city.<br/><br/>Step out onto your private balcony and take in sweeping views stretching across the Perth CBD, Maylands Peninsula, Swan River, golf course, Optus Stadium, and Crown Entertainment Complex - all complemented by stunning sunset skies.<br/><br/>Inside, the apartment features a functional open plan layout designed for relaxed living and entertaining. The light-filled bedrooms provide a comfortable retreat, while the well-appointed bathroom and practical kitchen add to the home's everyday appeal.<br/><br/>Residents can also enjoy access to the complex swimming pool and outdoor entertaining areas - perfect for cooling off during Perth's warmer months. With the Swan River just moments away, there are endless opportunities to enjoy walking trails, parklands, and the vibrant local lifestyle.<br/><br/>Conveniently located close to cafes, shops, public transport, and only a short commute to the Perth CBD, this apartment combines lifestyle and location in one attractive package.<br/><br/>Features You'll Love:<br/>Unbeatable panoramic views<br/>Fantastic riverside location<br/>Low-maintenance living<br/>Secure lock-and-leave lifestyle<br/>Private balcony<br/>Open plan living and dining<br/>Swimming pool within the complex<br/>Close to transport, cafes, and local amenities<br/><br/>Nearby Schools:<br/>Maylands Peninsula Primary School<br/>St Columba's Primary School<br/>Bayswater Primary School<br/>Perth College<br/>Mount Lawley Primary School<br/><br/>Don't miss the opportunity to secure this well-positioned apartment in one of Maylands' most desirable locations.<br/><br/>TO VIEW:<br/>You must register to view online with home open times scheduled by visiting our website: https://www.professionalstwt.com.au<br/><br/>TO APPLY:<br/>You can apply for this property using this link- https://2apply.com.au/agency/prowrightteam<br/>Applications will be processed only once you have attended the open, we accept applications via 2Apply and the Tenant App only.<br/><br/>ENQUIRIES:<br/>rentals@professionalstwt.com.au<br/>In these extremely busy times we endeavor to answer as many calls as possible but we highly encourage you to email for a response.",
